WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:02.300
When watching TV...

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.030
Please keep the room lit,
and sit away from the screen!
When watching TV...

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:05.770
Please keep the room lit,
and sit away from the screen!

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.550
I'm bored...

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.430
Darling...

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.690
I want to go with him, but...

00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:52.380
Don't follow me!

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:55.500
If you came to school with me,
you'd be a nuisance!

00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:59.900
If  you<i> came to school with me,
you'd be a nuisance!</i>

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:06.550
That's it! As long as I'm not "me,"
I can go to school!

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:39.830
Embraced and Happy?!
Bold!

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:43.250
Bold! Embraced and Happy?!
Embraced and Happy?!
Bold!

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:44.140
Embraced and Happy?!
Bold!

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:51.740
Gently...

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:53.720
...carefully...

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:59.600
Arrgh! I was so close, too!

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:01.180
Rizel!

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:08.540
Rizel, please open doors more quietly.

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:12.110
Of course!

00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:13.950
So, what should we do next?

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:16.070
How strange...

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:38.720
Rizel! Didn't Papa A
just warn you about that?

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:41.410
Eh? You could tell it was me, even in this?!

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:42.480
Obviously!

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:44.270
Why...?

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:49.150
Do you think Rizel-chan
might be trying to surprise us?

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:51.260
It does seem that way.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:54.580
She must be lonely without Tomonori-kun around.

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:59.580
Let's act surprised at her next disguise,
no matter what it is.

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:02.480
I want to see Rizel's happy face!

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:03.620
That's right!

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:05.580
She's here!

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:06.560
Ready?

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:07.420
Yes!

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:09.660
W-Who are you?!

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:13.420
Could this suspicious character be
a spy sent after our precious Rizel?!

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:15.770
You're right! With a face
like that, it must be!

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:18.440
Umm.. please don't get the laundry dirty.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:20.430
I just finished doing it all...

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:25.660
No mistaking it, that's Rizel.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:26.420
That's Rizel...

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:26.990
Definitely Rizel...

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:27.590
Rizel-chan, that's just too obvious...
Definitely Rizel...

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:29.230
Rizel-chan, that's just too obvious...

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:31.520
Ta-da!!

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:33.670
It was actually me!

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:36.570
Yay, yay! Nobody could tell!

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:39.260
R-Rizel?!

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:40.990
N-No... I was surprised...

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:43.570
...that it was Rizel... weren't you?

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:44.520
Y-Yeah...

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:46.310
We couldn't tell at all!

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:47.450
Right...

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:50.400
That's great! This really is perfect!

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:54.370
I'm off!

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:55.910
Okay, have fun!

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:57.400
Watch out for cars, okay?

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.590
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:03.440
Now, where could she possibly be going off to in that getup?

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:07.180
I finally remembered...!

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:09.100
What did you finally remember!?

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:12.570
Those were the nose-glasses that my husband bought for a party!

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:14.950
That doesn't matter!

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:25.030
I'm here! But the "me" right now isn't <i>me!</i>

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:31.140
Okay, doggy? Keep the fact that I'm Rizel...

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:34.000
...a secret from my husband.

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:43.020
Wow, "school" is such a huge place!

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:46.140
It'll be tough to find my husband in here!

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.860
Here I go! Yay!

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:53.320
So because of this, this part changes like so, to this...

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:57.480
...and so we end up with the answer that we were looking for.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:06:01.910
Darling, Darling... where are you, Darling?

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:08.860
Okay, so anyway... at this point, Hikaru Genji's mood is...

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:08.870
Hurry up and show yourself, Darling... Darling...!
Okay, so anyway... at this point, Hikaru Genji's mood is...

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:12.820
Hurry up and show yourself, Darling... Darling...!

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:17.760
You're ever so wonderful, Darling!

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:20.670
Oh, oh, wherever could you be?

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:24.240
My beloved husband...?

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:38.690
No one's here.

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:44.200
This is the only place left.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:47.290
I knew it... it's always best
to save the best for last!

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:48.620
Let's GO!

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:49.720
Okay, got it?!

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:51.780
Everything I'm going to discuss is going to be on the test!

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:54.900
Listen carefully, and don't get distracted!

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:57.870
Why is it?

00:06:57.870 --> 00:07:02.580
Why do I have to learn things that I already know?

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:03.970
How tiresome...

00:07:09.890 --> 00:07:11.310
Who is that?!

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:15.870
Not here, either...
Where could you be, Darling?

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:20.880
I need to watch where I'm going, don't I?

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:23.220
Huh? The glasses, the glasses...

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:24.970
Ah, there they are!

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:26.110
Okay!

00:07:28.890 --> 00:07:30.930
Too cute!!

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:33.830
Who could that lovely maiden be?

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.790
Disguise, disguise....

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:45.000
Ah! Th-Those are...

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:48.050
B-Bear print p-pa-

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:49.220
I can't say it!

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:51.950
No! A gentleman such as I mustn't peek

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:55.480
at a young maiden's beautiful white underclothes....

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:58.410
But... what a lovely maiden she is!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.010
Ow, ow, ow...

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:02.150
And this time I was watching
where I was going~

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:05.080
Anyway, I need to hurry up and find Darling!

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:06.360
Darling!

00:08:10.780 --> 00:08:13.110
Come on now, Class 3-B!

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:15.640
This is still "off-campus study"
until we get back to the classroom.

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:16.960
Let's not get too rowdy.

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:18.850
All right...

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:23.850
It snapped...

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.300
What's wrong, Iwaki-kun?

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:27.570
Nothing.

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:30.520
You were totally spacing out
and staring at Sensei.

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:31.850
What was that?!

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:33.490
You never know when to quit.

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:34.730
Lay off me!

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:37.020
I'm going on ahead.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:43.170
I ran around the school ten times, but I couldn't find him anywhere!

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:45.490
I'm tired of searching...

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:57.490
That's it! I've thought of a great idea!

00:08:58.460 --> 00:09:02.840
Man, they left me behind.
What a bunch of jerks.

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:06.380
What is it?

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.310
Did something happen?

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:11.590
Something strange is going on in there.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:13.010
Like what?

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:14.130
We don't know.

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:15.780
I'll check it out!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:16.770
Iwaki-kun!

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:23.110
No! Save me, Darling!

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:24.190
What the-
No! Save me, Darling!

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:29.320
Darling, save me!!

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:31.240
What are you doing, Rizel?!

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:32.860
Ah, Darling!

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:36.540
Er, no! I mean, who are you?
I am not Rizel!

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:38.980
Use the brake! The brake!

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:41.630
Not the boost, the brake!!

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:43.790
What's a "brake"?

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:47.740
You shouldn't drive if you don't know
what a brake is!!

00:09:52.140 --> 00:09:54.230
I caan't stooop iiiit!!!

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:56.850
You don't have to stop,
just slow down, please!!

00:09:56.850 --> 00:09:59.270
Why did she come to school?!

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:02.270
It's gonna crash! NOO!!

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:05.970
No more!!

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:07.250
Shit!

00:10:08.550 --> 00:10:10.100
Save me!!

00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:14.630
I'm not gonna make it!

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:24.000
It's hopeless!

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:37.890
Wha?

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:44.770
Darling... you saved me!

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:50.810
My husband's saved me for the first time!

00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:54.150
What the hell were you thinking when you got on that thing?!

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:58.320
I just thought I'd find you faster if I rode it!

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:00.400
Who told you to find me?!

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:02.650
Don't just run with
every stupid idea you have!

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:07.170
But I put so much thought into it...

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:09.840
D-D-Don't cry!

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:13.090
W-W-Wait! Are you going to cause an explosion here at school?!

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:13.720
It's no use! I'm gonna cry!
