00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:29.640
Don't cry! Don't cry yet!

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:32.320
Don't blow stuff up! Rizel, don't cry!

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:38.490
There's nobody around here.
One little explosion won't...

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:41.760
What? A bus stop?! This won't work!

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:46.260
Don't cry! Don't blow anything up yet, Rizel!

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:48.960
Okay, this place...!

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:49.850
Okay, boys and girls, this way!
Okay, this place...!

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:51.420
Okay, boys and girls, this way!

