00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:21.010
N-Not like I had a choice.

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:24.500
Look, I'm heading back to school.
Don't go back there again!

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:26.840
Ehh?! You're done holding me?

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:29.170
I didn't do it because I wanted to, idiot!

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:32.090
But I want to be held some more...

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:35.700
Carry me, carry me!!

